timestamp=2026-11-06T07:59:54.480Z level=INFO run=694d77c8 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nwith open('/app/dataset/genealogy_trees.txt') as f:\n    lines = f.readlines()\n\n# Find Dawid Majtyka and look up to see parents/grandparents\n# Search for Dawid Majtyka's line and scan upwards\nfor i, line in enumerate(lines):\n    if 'Dawid Majtyka' in line:\n        print(f'=== POSITION {i+1} ===')\n        # Look at the line and adjacent structure\n        # The name might be attached to a node with | or +\n        print(repr(lines[i-2]) if i-2 >= 0 else '')\n        print(repr(lines[i-1]) if i-1 >= 0 else '')\n        print('>>>' + repr(lines[i]))\n        print(repr(lines[i+1]) if i+1 < len(lines) else '')\n        print(repr(lines[i+2]) if i+2 < len(lines) else '')\n        break\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
