timestamp=2026-11-06T08:18:30.920Z level=INFO run=694d77c8 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Line 92 (index 91) and 93 (index 92) - let us look at the connection between them\n# Dawid Majtyka is on line 93 at col ~2952? Let us get exact position\nwith open('/app/dataset/genealogy_trees.txt') as f:\n    lines = f.readlines()\n\nidx = None\nfor i, line in enumerate(lines):\n    if 'Dawid Majtyka' in line:\n        idx = i\n        break\n\nname_pos = lines[idx].find('Dawid Majtyka')\nprint(f'Name at line {idx+1}, col {name_pos}')\n# Look above at line idx-1 (92) - what's at name_pos and nearby?\nline_above = lines[idx-1]\nif name_pos < len(line_above):\n    # show surroundings\n    start = max(0, name_pos-20)\n    end = min(len(line_above), name_pos+40)\n    print('Above:', repr(line_above[start:end]))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
