timestamp=2026-11-06T09:01:05.690Z level=INFO run=694d77c8 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Build parent-child map by finding all nodes and their parents\nwith open('/app/dataset/genealogy_trees.txt') as f:\n    lines = f.readlines()\n\n# Find all name occurrences (nodes)\nimport re\nnodes = []\nfor i, line in enumerate(lines):\n    matches = re.finditer(r'\\b[A-ZĄĆĘŁŃÓŚŹŻ][a-ząćęłńóśźż]+\\s+[A-ZĄĆĘŁŃÓŚŹŻ][a-ząćęłńóśźż]+\\b', line)\n    for m in matches:\n        nodes.append((i, m.start(), m.group(0)))\n\n# deduplicate nodes - same name might appear multiple times? probably not in same tree structure\n# keep unique (row, col, name) combos\nunique_nodes = []\nseen = set()\nfor n in nodes:\n    key = (n[0], n[1], n[2])\n    if key not in seen:\n        seen.add(key)\n        unique_nodes.append(n)\nprint(f'Total unique nodes: {len(unique_nodes)}')\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
