timestamp=2026-11-06T09:09:41.183Z level=INFO run=694d77c8 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# So Przemysław Kurczab (GGG) has only one direct child: Julita Kucharz.\n# But the task says \"sum the account balances of their direct children who have more than one grandchild\"\n# If Przemysław has only 1 direct child (Julita), then Julita must have > 1 grandchild for that child to qualify?\n# Or if there's only 1 child total, the condition \"more than one grandchild\" - let us check Julita's grandchildren count.\n# Also let us look back at the full lineage we traced: Julita Kucharz is a child of Przemysław, and also Julita is the parent of Kazimierz (who is Dawid's grandparent). And Kazimierz has children etc. So Julita's grandchildren - who are they?\n# Count grandchildren of Julita: grandchildren are children of Julita's children.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
