timestamp=2026-11-06T09:15:55.885Z level=INFO run=694d77c8 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# So among Julita's children (direct children of GGG Przemysław), \n# - Kazimierz Kaziród has 2 grandchildren (> 1) - so Kazimierz qualifies\n# - Franciszek Grabias has 0 grandchildren (not > 1) - does not qualify\n# Therefore we need to sum the account balances of the qualifying children of GGG - i.e. Kazimierz Kaziród\n# Now get account balances from people_accounts.csv\nimport csv\n\nbalances = {}\nwith open('/app/dataset/people_accounts.csv') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    for row in reader:\n        name = f\"{row['first_name']} {row['last_name']}\"\n        balances[name] = int(row['account_balance'])\n\n# look up Kazimierz Kaziród\nfor k in balances:\n    if 'Kazimierz' in k:\n        print(k, balances[k])\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
