timestamp=2026-11-06T09:16:30.898Z level=INFO run=694d77c8 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Found Kazimierz Kaziród with balance 39047\n# Are there any other direct children of GGG Przemysław with > 1 grandchild?\n# GGG Przemysław's direct children: only Julita Kucharz (from earlier). Among Julita's children, only Kazimierz has > 1 grandchild. So only Kazimierz qualifies as \"direct child of their GGG who has more than one grandchild\"?\n# Wait - read the question again carefully: \"sum the account balances of their direct children who have more than one grandchild\"\n# \"their\" refers to the great-great-grandparent (GGG). So the \"direct children\" are the children of that GGG. For each of those direct children, if that child has more than one grandchild, include that child's account balance in the sum.\n# So for each direct child C of GGG: count grandchildren of C. If count > 1, add balance(C) to sum.\n# So we sum balances of the DIRECT CHILDREN (of GGG), not their grandchildren.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
